      "answer": "FAA AD 2024-01-02 supersedes AD 2022-03-07, which in turn superseded AD 2020-05-11. The 2024 AD's references state that AD 2020-05-11 was partially superseded by AD 2022-03-07 and fully superseded by AD 2024-01-02.",
