      "answer": "The context does not specify an engine maintenance procedure required by FAA AD 2024-01-02. That AD requires MCAS Software v2.0 installation, an FCOM revision, an AOA sensor inspection, and compliance reporting-none of which are engine procedures. The CFM LEAP-1B engine mount inspection procedures appear in the CMM (737MAX_CMM_Engine_Mount), but the context does not state that AD 2024-01-02 requires them.",
