      "n_contexts": 12,
      "answer": "Southwest Airlines, American Airlines, and United Airlines are identified as the primary US operators of Boeing 737 MAX aircraft, and compliance with the MCAS-related ADs is mandatory for all Part 121 operators. British Horizon Airways also operates a 737-8 (G-ABCD) subject to FAA AD 2024-01-02. The context does not provide a complete list of all affected airlines worldwide.",
